# The JSON fields of every stored kind (the v1alpha1 runtime kinds and cmd/factory's
# internalKinds), a sorted set, at store.ReadableSchema below. A change here needs a
# pending ReadableSchema (SchemaVersion+1, bumped alone: expand-then-write,
# internal/store/schema.go). Changes join it until a release that reads it ships; then it
# is frozen until SchemaVersion catches up. To rewrite this file:
#   go test ./cmd/factory -run TestStoredSchema -update
readableSchema 1
